# Emotes and spells attached to lines, applied by tools/convert_play.py.
#
#   ROLE | first words of the line | action
#
# The action is an emote slash command (/laugh), a spell name (cast if the
# player knows it), or both: "Feign Death /lie" casts Feign Death if known,
# otherwise does /lie. Lines are matched ignoring punctuation and case.
# Stage directions like [Kisses her.] and [Hero swoons.] are mapped
# automatically, so only add things the text doesn't already say.

BEATRICE  | I wonder that you will still be talking | /sigh
BENEDICK  | What, my dear Lady Disdain               | /bow
